WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
I'm going to teach you
how to plan your dream

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.590
wedding, but on a budget.

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.750
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:07.950
I'm Mindy Weiss.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.740
And with my years
of experience, I'm

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:14.490
going to share all the
tips to wedding planning.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.750
I've got you.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:21.750
From your guest list,
invitations, attire,

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.290
photographer and
vendor selection,

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:28.530
to even your food selections.
At the end of this class,

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:31.190
you're going to feel confident
planning your wedding.

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:35.360
Here's a tip: a sip of
champagne is much more expensive

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.830
than a glass of wine.

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:39.440
Skip the champagne.

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:42.920
You're going to walk away from
this class with your wedding

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:47.120
binder that will have all
the details of your day

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.680
because an organized
couple is a happy couple.

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:54.730
[MUSIC PLAYING]

